    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Reassemble Corpses and Raise the Dead</p></blockquote><p>Reanimators defy the laws of nature in pursuit of gruesome experiments. These grim Artificers stitch servants together from mismatched corpses, use foul magic to strengthen the living, and turn necromancy into a terrifying science.</p><h3>Reanimator Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.zaIB2BtoOJPsDE3H]{Reanimator's Skill Set}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.08S1Gytnt0iVs3Hp]{Reanimated Companion}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.EqaVNzeH5spNshFJ]{Strange Modifications}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.eVyF4LZbNArqdaXJ]{Improved Reanimation}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.IpFQje2OyhtAZGDW]{Macabre Modifications}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.BZEalDf2KFECqhE7]{Refined Reanimation}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Reanimator Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Artificer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFalseLife0]{False Life}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSparetheDy]{Spare the Dying}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.i7HEDo5zc31gh5NA]{Witch Bolt}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlindnessD]{Blindness/Deafness}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplEnhanceAbi]{Enhance Ability}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAnimateDea]{Animate Dead}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLightningB]{Lightning Bolt}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlight0000]{Blight}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDeathWard0]{Death Ward}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAntilifeSh]{Antilife Shell}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRaiseDead0]{Raise Dead}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
